  "abstract": "Strengthen basis smoothness for Dynamic MoT by increasing the horizon second-difference penalty \u03bb_b_curv to 3e\u22126 (R=4, \u03b1=0.06, ctx_hidden=64). Tests whether overfitting/instability in B(x) caused prior regression.",
